  "notes": "SAL Saudi Logistics Services Company (ticker 4263) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/5026_0_2026-02-16...). Auditor: Ernst & Young Professional Services. The consolidated financial statements were approved by the Board of Directors on 10 February 2026 (22 Sha'aban 1447H, Note 37). Amounts are presented in thousands of Saudi Riyals (scale 1000). The primary statements (printed FS pages 5-8) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group (SAL and one subsidiary); equity has no non-controlling interest and there are no discontinued operations - the standard pre-tax - zakat bridge applies. SAL is a cargo-handling / logistics operator; the large right-of-use asset and lease liability are its airport and warehouse concession leases. impairment_charges is the 'Allowance for expected credit losses' P&L line - a small net reversal in both years (positive). other_income is 'Other income'. operating_income is the reported 'OPERATING PROFIT'; finance_income and finance_costs are the gross 'Finance income' and 'Finance cost' lines. income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'PROFIT BEFORE ZAKAT'; income_taxes_and_zakat is the single 'Zakat expense' line (the group pays zakat, not income tax). other_reserves combines the 'Reserve' (statutory reserve) and the negative 'Actuarial reserve'. prepayments combines 'Prepayments and other receivables' and the 'Sublease' asset. other_current_assets is the FY2024 current 'Long-term loan receivable' (nil at FY2025). other_noncurrent_assets is the 'Other non-current assets' line (nil at FY2024). long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current 'Long-term loans' and its 'current portion'. lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current lease liabilities. defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employees' benefit obligations'; accounts_payable is 'Trade payables'; accrued_expenses is 'Accrued expenses and other liabilities'; zakat_payable is 'Accrued Zakat'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation of property and equipment', 'Depreciation of right-of-use assets' and 'Amortisation of intangible assets' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Additions to property and equipment'; interest_paid sums 'Finance cost paid' and 'Payments of finance cost on lease liabilities'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividends paid'. The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 5, profit or loss and OCI 6, changes in equity 7, cash flows 8.",
